  },
  {
    "id": "P0005",
    "report": "A",
    "text": "When a queued timer\u2019s expiration becomes `None`, the iterator drops its node without clearing the cache entry\u2019s pointer to it. Later maintenance dereferences freed memory. Both cache implementations use this timer wheel.\n\n"
