  {
    "id": "P0006",
    "report": "A",
    "text": "Evidence: `timer_clear` creates a two-second expiration, waits 1.2 seconds, and reads with an expiry callback returning `None`. Subsequent maintenance panicked natively. Miri with Tree Borrows reported a dangling reference/use-after-free in `TimerWheel::unlink_timer`.\n\n"
