    "id": "P0049",
    "report": "A",
    "text": "Deferred invalidate_all removes values inserted after the invalidation call. src/future/base_cache.rs:398. future::Cache::invalidate_all defers removal to housekeeping, which later clears entries without distinguishing their insertion time from the invalidation request. If insert completes after invalidate_all returns but before run_pending_tasks, the next maintenance pass removes that new value as part of the earlier invalidation. This also discards a replacement written to a previously cached key during the interval, causing a successful post-invalidation write to disappear.\n\n"
